@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Editor" as Editor
participant "System" as System

activate Editor

    Editor -> System : request to create a scenario
    activate System

    System --> Editor : display available maps
    deactivate System

    Editor -> System : choose map from list
    activate System

    System --> Editor : request data (name, time restrictions, technological restrictions,\nhistorical restrictions)
    deactivate System

    Editor -> System : provide **invalid** name
    activate System

    System --> Editor : return error message ("ERROR: Invalid name. Must be under 15 characters,\nhave at least one upper case character, and can't be null")

    System --> Editor : request data (name, time restrictions, technological restrictions,\nhistorical restrictions)
    deactivate System

    Editor -> System : provide **valid** name
    activate System

    System --> Editor : returns success message ("Scenario created successfully.")\nand shows all data
    deactivate System



@enduml
